+Scratch exemption: a recursive delete skips the ask only when every rm in the
+command has literal targets that resolve (cwd from the payload plus plain cd
+chains, symlinks followed) strictly inside /tmp or /var/tmp. Any doubt (.., globs,
+~, $vars, substitutions, unknown flags, wrappers, ln, unknown cwd) keeps the ask.
+DENY is checked first and is never relaxed.
+
