+| `estate-guard-gate.py` | PreToolUse on Bash | **Denies**: force-push to main/master/production, `rm -rf` of root or home, `curl \| sh`, permission-bypass flags, history rewrites, secret deletion, destructive SQL, writes to global Claude settings, `chmod 777`. **Asks**: direct push to main, `reset --hard`, `clean -f`, any `rm -r` unless every target is provably inside `/tmp` or `/var/tmp`, unpinned `npx -y` / `@latest`, production deploys, db pushes, DELETE API calls, secret writes, email sends. |
